.", "details": {"citation_id": "CIT-BROWN-GOETZMANN-1997"}}, {"id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002", "type": "literature", "label": "On Mutual Fund Investment Styles", "details": {"authors": "Louis K. C. Chan; Hsiu-Lang Chen; Josef Lakonishok", "year": 2002, "doi": "10.1093/rfs/15.5.1407", "evidence_id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002"}}, {"id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002-MEASURE", "type": "measure", "label": "测度 · Holdings characteristics and return-based evidence for investment style.", "details": {"citation_id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002"}}, {"id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002-MECHANISM", "type": "mechanism", "label": "机制 · Portfolio characteristics reveal economically meaningful style choices.", "details": {"citation_id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002"}}, {"id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002-LIMITATION", "type": "limitation", "label": "局限 · Holdings snapshots are incomplete representations of trading between disclosure dates.", "details": {"citation_id": "CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002"}}, {"id": "G3", "type": "gap", "label": "经理变更、定期报告观点与外部宣讲尚未形成原文级事件证据链", "details": {"priority": "高", "evidence_ids": ["CIT-CHAN-CHEN-LAKONISHOK-2002"]}}, {"id": "H4", "type": "hypothesis", "label": "基金经理变更前后行业/风格暴露的 L2 位移至少为 0.5", "details": {"status": "supported", "evidence_ids": ["E4", "DATA-MANAGER"], "registered_before_test": true}}, {"id": "H5", "type": "hypothesis", "label": "相邻定期报告的经理观点主题距离至少为 0.20", "details": {"status": "supported", "evidence_ids": ["E5", "DATA-REPORTS"], "registered_before_test": true}}, {"id": "E4", "type": "experiment", "label": "基金经理换人前后，量化暴露是否发生显著位移？", "details": {"method": "经理任职起始日事件研究；比较事件前后 3 个滚动暴露估计", "result": {"status": "completed", "event_window": "three 6-month-exposure estimates before and after each start date", "pre_registered_shift_threshold": 0.5, "events": [{"date": "2025-04-23", "manager": "邓童", "exposure_shift_l2": 1.4327, "pre_months": 3, "post_months": 3}], "max_exposure_shift_l2": 1.4327}, "evidence_id": "E4"}}, {"id":